			</array>
		</dict>
	</array>
	<!-- LSEnvironment removed for distribution builds. It set:
	         DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH = $(HOME)/panua-pardiso-20240630-mac_arm64/lib
	         PARDISOLICMESSAGE = 1
	     None of which can work in a signed, distributed app:
	       1. Values here are literal — launchd does not expand $(HOME).
	       2. The hardened runtime strips every DYLD_* variable, so the
	          setting is inert in any notarizable build.
	       3. It points at a separately licensed Panua Pardiso install in the
	          developer's home directory, absent on any end user's machine.
	     The bundled Resources/febio.xml therefore selects the "accelerate"
	     solver. Restore this block only for local Pardiso development, and
	     keep it out of release builds. -->
</dict>
